Hence, the appeal merits consideration, in the result, the following:
ORDER i) Appeal is allowed-in-part;
ii) Impugned judgment and award is modified;
iii) Petitioner is entitled to enhanced compensation of Rs.16,500/- with interest @
NC: 2024:KHC:32441 6% p.a. from the date of petition till the date of deposit.
iv) The KSRTC shall satisfy the award within eight weeks from the date of receipt of certified copy of the judgment.

